{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16842","headline":"迁谪江表久未归 · 窦参","name":"迁谪江表久未归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一自经放逐，裴回无所从。\n便爲寒山云，不得随飞龙。\n名岂不欲保，归岂不欲早。\n苟无三月资，难适千里道。\n离心与羁思，终日常草草。\n人生年几齐，忧苦即先老。\n谁能假羽翼，使我畅怀抱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}